            "review_text": "Dong-Ha N\n1 contribution\n0\nItalian, Vietnamese, Indian, western pizza food. Walking distance from beach.\nFeb 2023 • Family\nDelicious place for all kinds of food. Variety of Italian, Indian, American or western foods. It was nice to take a break from Vietnamese food and visiting this place that’s only 5 minutes away from the beach, so very close to the beach. Good walking distance. They speak English. Live band, pool table. Good company and clean.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 22, 2023",
